[IQ Generator Preset]
# Lesson 18: pi/4-DQPSK.
# The phase changes by +45, +135, -135 or -45 degrees at every symbol, so the points alternate between two QPSK sets and the phase never jumps by 180 degrees. Open the matched-filter constellation: eight points on a circle. The envelope never reaches zero, and a receiver recovers the data from phase differences without carrier-phase recovery.
